'''Jasmine''' (Japanese: '''ミカン''' ''Mikan'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Wisdom of Sea and Sky}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=During your opponent's next turn, all of your {{TCGP|Steelix}} and {{DL|Skarmory (TCG Pocket)|Skarmory ex|Skarmory '''''<big>ex</big>'''''}} take −50 damage from attacks from your opponent's Pokémon.
}}

